om/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-20T15:11:03-08:00","id":1005873,"title":"","content":"I'd suggest something involving the Lhurgoyf, but &quot;Run Away&quot; is already a nightmare.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-20T18:42:53-08:00","id":1005931,"title":"","content":"Ach! Hans, run! (Sorry, couldn't resist. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )<br /> <br /> I'd love to make a Beast around my favorite Commander: the Mimeoplasm. I'd see it as a Namtaru Ravager that literally uproots graves to feed upon the dead, not for nourishment from the cadavers but from the turmoil it would cause the families of the departed. If I was inclined to have this Beast adhere to the lessons of the Dark Mother, he would try to teach the families to let go of their departed loved ones, for a corpse isn't the same as a beloved friend or relative. It's just a corpse.<br /> <br /> That being said...they prooooobably wouldn't get along with many Sin-Eaters or Ghosts. - . -'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":".  Polish. 11-20-2016, 09:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"us